sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant S as Private S3
  B->>A: POST /v1/transfers (descriptors + idempotency key)
  A->>D: Validate quota + insert CREATED and files
  D-->>A: Committed
  A-->>B: Management secret + signed upload URLs
  par Max 3 concurrent uploads
    B->>S: Signed PUT object 1
    B->>S: Signed PUT object N
  end
  B->>A: POST /v1/transfers/id/complete
  A->>D: Claim VERIFYING (CAS)
  loop Expected files (bounded fanout)
    A->>S: HEAD object / verify size
  end
  A->>D: Commit READY if valid and unexpired
  A-->>B: Public share link
